<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>技术 on AI驱动数字化转型</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/</link><description>Recent content in 技术 on AI驱动数字化转型</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>模型的终点不是训练完成，而是跟工厂一起长：一个阀门垂直模型怎么做起来</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/valve-vertical-model-factory/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/valve-vertical-model-factory/</guid><description>一个阀门厂不需要能聊康德的大模型，需要的是回答这台球阀为什么内漏时直接给排查方向的小模型。本文完整复盘一个阀门垂直模型的训练过程：数据集怎么造、基座怎么选、评测怎么避坑、模型怎么跟工厂一起长。</description></item><item><title>三种AI编码Agent，三种循环哲学，你的代码在用哪种方式写？</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8Dai%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81agent%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%A8%E5%93%AA%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%86%99/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8Dai%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81agent%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%A8%E5%93%AA%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%86%99/</guid><description>Claude Code双环、Codex扁平大环、CodeAgent三阶段环。循环的价值不在于跑多少圈，而在于恰好在需要的时候停下来。</description></item><item><title>你觉得AI记不住东西是个问题？真正的麻烦是它忘不掉、改不动</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BD%A0%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97ai%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%E5%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%89%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BD%A0%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97ai%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%E5%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%89%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>AI真正难的不是记不住，而是记住之后改不动、改了带崩一片、连旧的也忘了。记忆的本质不是存储，是把经验压成能改变未来行为的更新方向。</description></item></channel></rss>